    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765250/extras/c0e1d2e8b9787cfb3075fa840d7e8eda.avif?t=1750393206\" data-has-big width=800 height=380 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2756 Game Description (English) \u2756</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fantasy game set in an alternate history of Joseon Korea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of desperate prayers, a new deity\u2014<strong>the God of Lamentation</strong>\u2014was born.  <br>But the god turned traitor, plunging Joseon into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the divine turmoil reached a point beyond salvation, the gods intervened,  <br>shifting Joseon into a different timeline\u2014  <br>a world that now stands in resistance against the God of Lamentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joseon is already being devoured by corruption...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand with Joseon.  <br>Defy the God of Lamentation and the arcane forces that threaten the nation!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Key Features \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Shape-Shifting with &quot;Tal&quot; (Traditional Korean Masks)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your appearance and combat style by changing your <strong>Tal</strong>.  <br>Each mask grants different forms, allowing for faster movement or wider attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Combat with Visual &quot;Themes&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles enriched with traditional <strong>Korean aesthetics</strong>.  <br>Strike with black and white ink-like effects, painting your path to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Easy but Strategic &quot;Overpaint&quot; Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against powerful foes and hordes of enemies,  <br>paint them in <strong>black</strong> or <strong>white</strong>, then stack <strong>&quot;Overpaint&quot;</strong>  <br>to unleash devastating <strong>Execution</strong> finishers!  <br>  <br>  <br>  <br>Though originally developed as a portfolio piece,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your feedback and reviews will greatly help shape future projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome your thoughts!  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765250/extras/c0e1d2e8b9787cfb3075fa840d7e8eda.avif?t=1750393206\" data-has-big width=800 height=380 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2756 Game Description (English) \u2756</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fantasy game set in an alternate history of Joseon Korea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of desperate prayers, a new deity\u2014<strong>the God of Lamentation</strong>\u2014was born.  <br>But the god turned traitor, plunging Joseon into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the divine turmoil reached a point beyond salvation, the gods intervened,  <br>shifting Joseon into a different timeline\u2014  <br>a world that now stands in resistance against the God of Lamentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joseon is already being devoured by corruption...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand with Joseon.  <br>Defy the God of Lamentation and the arcane forces that threaten the nation!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 Key Features \u25a0\u25a0\u25a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Shape-Shifting with &quot;Tal&quot; (Traditional Korean Masks)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your appearance and combat style by changing your <strong>Tal</strong>.  <br>Each mask grants different forms, allowing for faster movement or wider attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Combat with Visual &quot;Themes&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles enriched with traditional <strong>Korean aesthetics</strong>.  <br>Strike with black and white ink-like effects, painting your path to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Easy but Strategic &quot;Overpaint&quot; Mechanic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against powerful foes and hordes of enemies,  <br>paint them in <strong>black</strong> or <strong>white</strong>, then stack <strong>&quot;Overpaint&quot;</strong>  <br>to unleash devastating <strong>Execution</strong> finishers!  <br>  <br>  <br>  <br>Though originally developed as a portfolio piece,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your feedback and reviews will greatly help shape future projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome your thoughts!  </p>",
    "short_description": "SaHwa: Black Tortoise is a third-person action-adventure game created in Unity for portfolio purposes. Set in a fantasy version of Joseon, players fight to protect the land from rising threats. Each character has unique skills and passives. Use them to defeat enemies in this single-player journey.",
